1 appropriated and received for that purpose, then three (3)
2 directors representing sportsmen and hunters from the
3 district shall be appointed to the board of directors by
4 the county commissioners serving the local district.
5 Sportsmen and hunter representatives shall be bona fide
6 residents of the district not engaged in raising sheep or
7 cattle and shall hold or have held a valid Wyoming fishing
8 or hunting license within the preceding twelve (12)
9 twenty-four (24) month period. County commissioners, to
10 the greatest extent practical, shall select sportsmen and
11 hunter representatives to ensure representation from as
12 broad a geographic distribution of the district as
13 possible. The county commissioners shall determine who of
14 the three (3) sportsmen and hunter directors appointed to a
15 board under this paragraph shall serve an initial term
16 terms of one (1) year, who shall serve an initial term of
17 (2) years and who thereafter shall serve a term for terms
18 of three (3) years. Thereafter, each term shall be for
19 three (3) No sportsman and hunter director shall serve for
20 a period of more than nine (9) years.
